## Algorithm beyond the brief (29 October 2026)

- T junctions : a free arc end within 3 cm of another arc splits it (37 on the car). (29 October 2026)
- Corners : turn above 35 degrees ; faces under 4 corners take their sharpest nodes (above 10 degrees, spaced) ; at most 2 virtual corners, else skipped as round_face. (29 October 2026)
- Fill : Coons, harmonic (Tutte) interior, guided projection along the face normal, relaxation ; harmonic took folded quads from 817 to 462 on the car. (29 October 2026)
- Counts : elastic milp marks infeasible faces, then a hard solve ; spokes at least 2 edges, loop arcs at least 3. (29 October 2026)
- auto_fallback : a failing 5 or 6 sided face is rebuilt as 4 sided when that folds less (faces 3, 19, 64 on the car). (29 October 2026)

